Generated by `defwork/diagAll.py`.  The companion is `x □ y = if x = y then A(x) else x ◇ y`,
which agrees with `◇` off the diagonal and so needs only one extra fact -- a `□`-word that names
the discarded `x ◇ x` at every `a ≠ x`.
-/

